translateer (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ask the translation direction once for each language of the text and
    remember it; Ctrl+Alt+Shift+E and the "Other direction" button pick
    another one.
  * Assign Ctrl+Alt+Shift+E on first launch, only if it is free.
  * Trim texts longer than 2000 characters with a warning instead of
    returning an empty translation.
  * Keep a single translation window: a new translation appears in the
    window that is already open, keeping its place and size; the size is
    remembered after closing. The window is now a GTK 4 application.
  * Offer "Retry" instead of back-translating an error message.
  * Fix detection of Russian text: grep rejected the [А-Я] range in the
    C.UTF-8 locale.

 -- andriiakishyn <andriiakishyn@gmail.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:20:00 +0300

